n\n1. **`Section_July19_Praise_Songs.lua`**: Sections off all 5 songs and preserves all spoken sharings in between (color-coded **Teal** for songs, **Orange** for speaking, with **Cyan** markers on each song).\n2. **`Create_July19_Songs_Only.lua`**: Stitches only the 5 songs seamlessly back-to-back (removes all speaking and prayers, resulting in a ~17:53 continuous worship set).\n\n#### Steps to Run:\n1. Open **DaVinci Resolve** and make sure `RLCF Praise Live — July 19, 2026.mp4` is imported into your **Media Pool**.\n2. Go to the top menu bar:\n   **Workspace** $\\rightarrow$ **Scripts** $\\rightarrow$ **Edit**\n3. Click either:\n   - **`Section_July19_Praise_Songs`** (for the full sectioned praise set)\n   - **`Create_July19_Songs_Only`** (for songs only)\n\nYour new timeline will be generated instantly with markers and color tags applied.\n\n---\n\n### 📋 YouTube Video Description Timestamps\n\n#### Option A: Full Recording Chapters (Songs & Spoken Sharings)\n```text\n00:00 Opening Prayer\n02:11 What a Faithful God Have I\n05:19 Sharing: Encourage Yourself in the Lord\n06:14 Why So Downcast, O My Soul\n08:09 Prayer & Consecration at the Altar\n20:48 Burn, Fire of God! (My Ransomed Soul Possessing)\n24:56 Sharing: Christ Our True Treasure\n26:43 Christ Is Mine Forevermore\n30:37 Footprints of Jesus (Sweetly, Lord, Have We Heard Thee Calling)\n```\n\n#### Option B: Songs Only Timeline\n```text\n00:00 What a Faithful God Have I\n03:08 Why So Downcast, O My Soul\n05:03 Burn, Fire of God! (My Ransomed Soul Possessing)\n09:11 Christ Is Mine Forevermore\n13:05 Footprints of Jesus (Sweetly, Lord, Have We Heard Thee Calling)\n```\n\n---\n\n### ☁️ Cloud & GitHub Backup Status\n- Both scripts have been copied to your local OneDrive sync folder:\n  `C:\\Users\\djtwo\\OneDrive\\RLCF-Video-Automation-Backup\\`\n- Both scripts have been committed and pushed to your private GitHub repository:\n  [`https://github.com/davelane26/rlcf-video-automation`](https://github.com/davelane26/rlcf-video-automation)","truncated_fields":["content"]}
