{"step_index":595,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T23:56:34Z","content":"Here is all you need to do right now:\n\n### Step 1: Open DaVinci Resolve\nOpen your project in **DaVinci Resolve**.\n\n### Step 2: Make Sure the Video is in the Media Pool\nCheck your **Media Pool** (top-left panel). If `RLCF Praise Live — July 19, 2026.mp4` is not in there yet, simply drag it from your **Downloads** folder into the Media Pool.\n\n### Step 3: Run the Script with One Click\nIn the very top menu bar of DaVinci Resolve, click:\n> **Workspace** $\\rightarrow$ **Scripts** $\\rightarrow$ **Edit** $\\rightarrow$ **`Section_July19_Praise_Songs`**\n\n*(Or choose **`Create_July19_Songs_Only`** if you only want the 5 songs without any speaking).*\n\n---\n\n### That's it! \nAs soon as you click the script:\n- A new timeline will be instantly created.\n- All 5 songs will be sliced cleanly, colored **Teal**, and tagged with **Cyan markers** showing the song names.\n- The speaking and prayer parts will be colored **Orange**.\n- When you are ready to upload to YouTube, simply copy and paste the **YouTube Timestamps** from above into your YouTube description box."}
