song with markers and color tags.\n26: - `Resolve_Scripts/Create_Singing_Timeline.lua`: Creates a single continuous timeline of the full singing session (`00:06:18` to `00:36:13`).\n27: - `Resolve_Scripts/Create_No_Singing_Timeline.lua`: Cuts out singing and keeps only the sermon and spoken portions.\n28: - `Antigravity_Skill/SKILL.md`: The AI workflow memory and rules for Antigravity.\n29: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
